nless face makes her difficult to read."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She excels at rational thinking and only speaks when absolutely necessary. Her observational skills are second to none, and she never takes her eyes off Rei. However, he finds her habit of examining things up close and personal rather unnerving."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c161601"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f1/f16043cb39a098bcfc404a69891f991414b775a2d92bdbc18faaae4d80096021.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5d/5d08bb1546ad8cf7894ddef096d37f51b22871d93bc5447b4b62e2551a6a831e.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"遠野 ひかる","creatorId":"vndb:s26804","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s26804","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s26804","name":"遠野 ひかる","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:101884","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c161602","characterName":"アイリーン＝セル","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c161602"},"originalCharacterName":"アイリーン＝セル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The administrator of Initium, the Domed City. For reasons unknown, she declared Rei the city's \"Messiah.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is considered the most powerful among the TUNED, commanding their fear and respect."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A certain rule Irene lives by ends up drastically changing Rei's fate."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c161602"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ee/ee18e4cb1cab883a46ebd456d3cdfef64bf937fd16